    "# 节点巡检\n新口径：延迟超过 2 秒先复测一次，两次都超时才记异常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Node Check\nNew rule: if latency exceeds 2 seconds, retest once; only record an anomaly if both attempts time out."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 节点巡检\n新口径：延迟超过 2 秒先复测一次，两次都超时才记异常。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 節點巡檢\n新口徑：延遲超過 2 秒先複測一次，兩次都逾時才記異常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# 节点巡检\n旧口径：延迟超过 2 秒即异常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Node Check\nOld rule: latency over 2 seconds counts as an anomaly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 节点巡检\n旧口径：延迟超过 2 秒即异常。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# 節點巡檢\n舊口徑：延遲超過 2 秒即異常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
