    "OneDay 只与你自己的服务器通信；凭据存本机钥匙串，聊天记录存本机，服务端数据归你所有。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OneDay only talks to your own server. Credentials are stored in this device's keychain, chat records stay on this device, and the server data belongs to you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OneDay 只与你自己的服务器通信；凭据存本机钥匙串，聊天记录存本机，服务端数据归你所有。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OneDay 只與你自己的伺服器通訊；憑證存本機鑰匙圈，聊天記錄存本機，伺服器端資料歸你所有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OneDay 客户端以开源形式发布于 GitHub 仓库（github.com/yyyyymmmmm/oneday-app），其使用与分发遵循仓库内所附的许可证。Hermes 为 Nous Research 的开源项目，权利归其权利人所有。本协议提及的其他名称与标识归各自权利人所有，不表示隶属或背书关系。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The OneDay client is published as open source in its GitHub repository (github.com/yyyyymmmmm/oneday-app), and its use and distribution are governed by the license included in that repository. Hermes is an open-source project of Nous Research, and rights in it belong to its rights holders. Other names and marks mentioned in this agreement belong to their respective owners and imply no affiliation or endorsement."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OneDay 客户端以开源形式发布于 GitHub 仓库（github.com/yyyyymmmmm/oneday-app），其使用与分发遵循仓库内所附的许可证。Hermes 为 Nous Research 的开源项目，权利归其权利人所有。本协议提及的其他名称与标识归各自权利人所有，不表示隶属或背书关系。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OneDay 用戶端以開源形式發佈於 GitHub 倉庫（github.com/yyyyymmmmm/oneday-app），其使用與散佈遵循倉庫內所附的授權條款。Hermes 為 Nous Research 的開源專案，權利歸其權利人所有。本協議提及的其他名稱與標識歸各自權利人所有，不表示隸屬或背書關係。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OneDay 开源项目": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OneDay Open Source Project"
          }
