    "会话只在 App 前台时活着；未连接时智能体叫不到这台手机，回到前台会自动恢复连接。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The session is only alive while the app is in the foreground. When it isn't connected, the agent can't reach this phone; bringing the app forward restores the connection automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话只在 App 前台时活着；未连接时智能体叫不到这台手机，回到前台会自动恢复连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段只在 App 前景時活著；未連接時智慧代理叫不到這台手機，回到前景會自動恢復連接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
