    "先选一个类别，再起名字、写下备注和里程碑，目标就会出现在这里，进展和简报会慢慢长出来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a category first, then give it a name, notes, and milestones. The goal will appear here, and its progress and briefs will grow over time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先选一个类别，再起名字、写下备注和里程碑，目标就会出现在这里，进展和简报会慢慢长出来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先選一個類別，再起名字、寫下備註和里程碑，目標就會出現在這裡，進展和簡報會慢慢長出來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先预演看将删条数，确认后才会真删；真删不可恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview first to see how many will be deleted. Nothing is actually deleted until you confirm — and real deletion can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先预演看将删条数，确认后才会真删；真删不可恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先預演看將刪條數，確認後才會真刪；真刪不可回復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
