    "写下你感兴趣什么，我每天替你去看；第一轮明早 8:30 到。站内的新点子、新简报也会汇编到这里。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write down what you're interested in and I'll go look for you every day. The first round arrives tomorrow at 8:30. New ideas and briefs from within the app are gathered here too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写下你感兴趣什么，我每天替你去看；第一轮明早 8:30 到。站内的新点子、新简报也会汇编到这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "寫下你感興趣什麼，我每天替你去看；第一輪明早 8:30 到。站內的新點子、新簡報也會彙編到這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
