          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只對這條對話生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只改名字，文件还在原来的文件夹。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the name changes — the file stays in the same folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只改名字，文件还在原来的文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只改名字，檔案還在原來的資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只改这台手机上的称呼，不改动服务器上的智能体身份。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes only the name on this phone. The agent identity on the server is not changed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只改这台手机上的称呼，不改动服务器上的智能体身份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只改這台手機上的稱呼，不改動伺服器上的智慧代理身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有主模型彻底用不了时才按顺序换，不做负载均衡。长按拖动可排序。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fallbacks kick in in order only when the main model is completely unusable — there's no load balancing. Long-press and drag to reorder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有主模型彻底用不了时才按顺序换，不做负载均衡。长按拖动可排序。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有主模型徹底用不了時才按順序換，不做負載平衡。長按拖動可排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只碰 OneDay 文件夹里的文件": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only touches files in OneDay's folder"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只碰 OneDay 文件夹里的文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只碰 OneDay 資料夾裡的檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能打开白名单目标；打开即离开 OneDay，设备会话会随之断开，回到 App 后自动恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only allowlisted targets open. Opening one leaves OneDay and the device session drops; it recovers when you return to the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能打开白名单目标；打开即离开 OneDay，设备会话会随之断开，回到 App 后自动恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能打開白名單目標；打開即離開 OneDay，裝置工作階段會隨之中斷，回到 App 後自動恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能按名运行、不能枚举你的快捷指令；运行中你会离开 OneDay 一阵，回来之后才有结果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcuts can only be run by name — your list cannot be enumerated. A run takes you out of OneDay for a while; the result arrives when you come back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能按名运行、不能枚举你的快捷指令；运行中你会离开 OneDay 一阵，回来之后才有结果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能按名運行、不能列舉你的快捷指令；運行中你會離開 OneDay 一陣，回來之後才有結果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只识别 OneDay 文件夹里的图片；识别在手机本地完成，图片不上传。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only images inside OneDay's folder are recognized, entirely on this phone; images are never uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只识别 OneDay 文件夹里的图片；识别在手机本地完成，图片不上传。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只識別 OneDay 資料夾裡的圖片；識別在手機本地完成，圖片不上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
