    "只限 OneDay 自己文件夹内的文本文件；单次读取/写入上限 256 KB，路径越出这个文件夹一律拒绝。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limited to text files inside OneDay's own folder. 256 KB max per read or write, and any path outside the folder is refused."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只限 OneDay 自己文件夹内的文本文件；单次读取/写入上限 256 KB，路径越出这个文件夹一律拒绝。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只限 OneDay 自己資料夾內的文字檔案；單次讀取/寫入上限 256 KB，路徑越出這個資料夾一律拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以上传文件或新建文件夹。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can upload files or create a new folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以上传文件或新建文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以上傳檔案或新建資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以用伴生服务的面板密码登录，也可以用 Hermes 的 API 密钥登录；密钥在 Hermes 服务端的配置中生成。连接不上先在「当前服务器」里重新测试连接。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can sign in with the companion service's panel password or with a Hermes API key; keys are generated in the Hermes server configuration. If you cannot connect, retest the connection under “Current Server” first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以用伴生服务的面板密码登录，也可以用 Hermes 的 API 密钥登录；密钥在 Hermes 服务端的配置中生成。连接不上先在「当前服务器」里重新测试连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以用伴生服務的面板密碼登入，也可以用 Hermes 的 API 金鑰登入；金鑰在 Hermes 伺服器端的設定中產生。連不上先在「目前伺服器」裡重新測試連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以重试一次；还不行就修改连接信息，或看看连接帮助。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try once more; if it still fails, edit the connection details or see the connection help."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以重试一次；还不行就修改连接信息，或看看连接帮助。"
