    "子目标、进展记录与简报会一并删除。挂在这个目标上的点子会解除关联（点子本身保留）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sub-goals, progress records, and briefs will be deleted together. Ideas linked to this goal will be unlinked (the ideas themselves are kept)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子目标、进展记录与简报会一并删除。挂在这个目标上的点子会解除关联（点子本身保留）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子目標、進展記錄與簡報會一併刪除。掛在這個目標上的點子會解除關聯（點子本身保留）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "子目标只分一层；完成子目标不会自动完成这个目标。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sub-goals go only one level deep. Completing a sub-goal doesn't automatically complete this goal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子目标只分一层；完成子目标不会自动完成这个目标。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子目標只分一層；完成子目標不會自動完成這個目標。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
