    "审批已结束，不需要再次批准。已批准不等于已执行成功，请核对执行记录。": {
      "comment": "通知详情审批类固定提示（用户原型亲定稿，逐字）",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This approval has ended; no further approval is needed. Approval does not guarantee successful execution — please check the execution record."
