    "密钥已保存到服务端，但提供商条目没写成；再保存一次即可（同名密钥会被覆盖）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key was saved on the server, but the provider entry wasn't written. Save once more (a key with the same name will be overwritten)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密钥已保存到服务端，但提供商条目没写成；再保存一次即可（同名密钥会被覆盖）。"
          }
        },
