    "打开 Discord 开发者门户": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the Discord Developer Portal"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Discord 开发者门户"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 Discord 開發者門戶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 Discord 开发者门户，新建一个应用，进 Bot 页点 Reset Token 拿到机器人令牌。在同一页打开 Message Content Intent 开关——不开这个开关，机器人收不到消息内容。再用 OAuth2 页给出的链接把机器人邀进你的服务器。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the Discord Developer Portal, create an application, and on the Bot page click Reset Token to get the bot token. On the same page, turn on the Message Content Intent switch — without it the bot can't receive message content. Then use the link from the OAuth2 page to invite the bot into your server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Discord 开发者门户，新建一个应用，进 Bot 页点 Reset Token 拿到机器人令牌。在同一页打开 Message Content Intent 开关——不开这个开关，机器人收不到消息内容。再用 OAuth2 页给出的链接把机器人邀进你的服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 Discord 開發者門戶，新建一個應用，進 Bot 頁點 Reset Token 拿到機器人令牌。在同一頁開啟 Message Content Intent 開關——不開這個開關，機器人收不到消息內容。再用 OAuth2 頁給出的連結把機器人邀進你的伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 QQ 机器人开放平台": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the QQ Bot open platform"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 QQ 机器人开放平台"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 QQ 機器人開放平台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 QQ 机器人开放平台，用你的 QQ 登录，创建一个机器人。然后到「开发设置」页，记下 AppID 和 Client Secret 两串钥匙——那是这个机器人的钥匙，不是你的账号密码。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the QQ Bot open platform, sign in with your QQ, and create a bot. Then go to the Development Settings page and note the two keys, AppID and Client Secret — they're the bot's keys, not your account password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 QQ 机器人开放平台，用你的 QQ 登录，创建一个机器人。然后到「开发设置」页，记下 AppID 和 Client Secret 两串钥匙——那是这个机器人的钥匙，不是你的账号密码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 QQ 機器人開放平台，用你的 QQ 登入，創建一個機器人。然後到「開發設定」頁，記下 AppID 和 Client Secret 兩串鑰匙——那是這個機器人的鑰匙，不是你的帳號密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 Slack 应用后台": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the Slack app console"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Slack 应用后台"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 Slack 應用後台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 Slack 应用后台，新建一个 App。先在 Socket Mode 页打开开关、生成一把 App Token；再到 OAuth & Permissions 页把 App 装进你的工作区，拿到 Bot Token。两把钥匙都要，一把都不能少。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the Slack app console and create an app. First turn on Socket Mode and generate an App Token; then, on the OAuth & Permissions page, install the app to your workspace to get the Bot Token. You need both keys — neither is optional."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Slack 应用后台，新建一个 App。先在 Socket Mode 页打开开关、生成一把 App Token；再到 OAuth & Permissions 页把 App 装进你的工作区，拿到 Bot Token。两把钥匙都要，一把都不能少。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 Slack 應用後台，新建一個 App。先在 Socket Mode 頁開啟開關、生成一把 App Token；再到 OAuth & Permissions 頁把 App 裝進你的工作區，拿到 Bot Token。兩把鑰匙都要，一把都不能少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开上方那一个开关会跳到系统设置，在那里打开%@权限后即可。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning on the switch above jumps to system Settings, where you can turn on %@ access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开上方那一个开关会跳到系统设置，在那里打开%@权限后即可。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開上方那一個開關會跳到系統設定，在那裡打開%@權限後即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开上方那一个开关，系统会问你是否允许读取%@。": {
