    "断开不会删除聊天记录。维护操作执行前需要确认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnecting won't delete chat history. Maintenance operations require confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开不会删除聊天记录。维护操作执行前需要确认。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "斷開不會刪除聊天記錄。維護操作執行前需要確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "断开只摘掉这边的凭据；厂商那边的密钥请到厂商处吊销。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnecting only removes the credentials here. Revoke the key at the provider to invalidate it there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开只摘掉这边的凭据；厂商那边的密钥请到厂商处吊销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中斷連接只摘掉這邊的憑證；廠商那邊的金鑰請到廠商處撤銷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "断开只摘掉这边的登记与保存的登录信息。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnecting only removes the registration and the sign-in details saved on this side."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开只摘掉这边的登记与保存的登录信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "斷開只會移除這邊的登記與保存的登入資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "断开只摘掉这边的登记与凭据；VPS 上的代理程序要用它自带的卸载命令才算全清。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnecting only removes the registration and credentials here. To fully remove the agent program on the VPS, run its own uninstall command."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "断开只摘掉这边的登记与凭据；VPS 上的代理程序要用它自带的卸载命令才算全清。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中斷連接只摘掉這邊的登記與憑證；VPS 上的代理程式要用它自帶的解除安裝指令才算全清。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
