    "服务器上的写入审批还没有开通记忆条目。开通后，智能体的长期记忆会逐条出现在这里。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write approval for memory entries isn't enabled on the server yet. Once it is, the agent's long-term memory will appear here entry by entry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器上的写入审批还没有开通记忆条目。开通后，智能体的长期记忆会逐条出现在这里。"
