    "服务器上还没有开通监测。开通后，你盯着的页面和对象有变化就会出现在这里。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Monitoring isn't enabled on the server yet. Once it is, changes to the pages and things you're watching will appear here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器上还没有开通监测。开通后，你盯着的页面和对象有变化就会出现在这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器上還沒有開通監測。開通後，你盯著的頁面和對象有變化就會出現在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "服务器上这项服务还没有开通。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
