          }
        }
      }
    },
    "步数来自手机自己的计步，系统只留最近 7 天左右；同步到服务器后按天攒着，攒出更长的记录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Step counts come from the phone's own counter, and the system only keeps about the last 7 days. Once synced to the server they're kept day by day, building a longer record."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "步数来自手机自己的计步，系统只留最近 7 天左右；同步到服务器后按天攒着，攒出更长的记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "步數來自手機自己的計步，系統只留最近 7 天左右；同步到伺服器後按天攢著，攢出更長的記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
