    "每一步都以服务器的真实回应为准，通常几秒内完成。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every step waits for the server's real answer — usually a few seconds."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一步都以服务器的真实回应为准，通常几秒内完成。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一步都以伺服器的真實回應為準，通常幾秒內完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个模型都标了从哪条路走：经网关，或直连某家提供商（直连不经过网关、没有网关的用量记录）。点经网关的模型可设为默认。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each model is labeled with its route: through the gateway, or directly to a provider (direct connections bypass the gateway and have no gateway usage records). Tap a gateway model to set it as the default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个模型都标了从哪条路走：经网关，或直连某家提供商（直连不经过网关、没有网关的用量记录）。点经网关的模型可设为默认。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個模型都標了從哪條路走：經閘道，或直連某家提供商（直連不經過閘道、沒有閘道的用量記錄）。點經閘道的模型可設為預設。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个用途用哪个模型，在这里分。没单独指定的用途，跟随主模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assign a model to each purpose here. Anything not assigned follows the main model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个用途用哪个模型，在这里分。没单独指定的用途，跟随主模型。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個用途用哪個模型，在這裡分。沒單獨指定的用途，跟隨主模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
