    "登录信息只发给你的服务端保存，App 不留存；连上之后，装代理、接进智能体的事都由服务端处理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign-in details are sent only to your own server for safekeeping — the app doesn't keep them. Once connected, the server takes care of installing the agent and wiring it up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录信息只发给你的服务端保存，App 不留存；连上之后，装代理、接进智能体的事都由服务端处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入資訊只會送到你自己的伺服器保存，App 不留存；連上之後，安裝代理、接進智慧代理的事都由伺服器處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
