    "系统只告诉 OneDay 这次验证过没过，你的面容与指纹数据永远不出系统、App 碰不到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system only tells OneDay whether this check passed. Your face and fingerprint data never leave the system and the app cannot touch it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统只告诉 OneDay 这次验证过没过，你的面容与指纹数据永远不出系统、App 碰不到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統只告訴 OneDay 這次驗證過沒過，你的面容與指紋資料永遠不出系統、App 碰不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统弹窗与分享界面等由系统显示的部分，仍跟随系统语言。": {
