    "语音输入没开权限，暂时用不了。去设置里打开麦克风，或者直接打字、用键盘自带的听写。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice input doesn't have permission yet, so it can't be used for now. Turn on the microphone in Settings, or just type, or use the keyboard's built-in dictation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音输入没开权限，暂时用不了。去设置里打开麦克风，或者直接打字、用键盘自带的听写。"
          }
