    "输入关键词搜索可安装的技能。服务端会直接连接外部技能库，网络不通时可能较慢或失败。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a keyword to search for installable skills. The server connects directly to the external skill library — it may be slow or fail when the network is unreachable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入关键词搜索可安装的技能。服务端会直接连接外部技能库，网络不通时可能较慢或失败。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "輸入關鍵字搜尋可安裝的技能。伺服器端會直接連接外部技能庫，網路不通時可能較慢或失敗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
