    "改名会直接改服务器上的身份名，所有地方看到的都会跟着变。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Renaming changes the identity name on your server directly — every place that shows it will change too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改名会直接改服务器上的身份名，所有地方看到的都会跟着变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改名會直接改伺服器上的身份名，所有地方看到的都會跟著變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "智能体只能打开这一张名单里的目标，名单之外的链接一律打不开。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant can only open targets on this list; links outside the list cannot be opened at all."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体只能打开这一张名单里的目标，名单之外的链接一律打不开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智慧代理只能開啟這一張名單裡的目標，名單之外的連結一律打不開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无人设内容，点下方编辑添加。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
