    },
    "每次调用都是一次单次问答，不记上文；回答在本机生成，不联网。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each call is a one-off question and answer with no memory of the context; answers are generated on this phone and never go online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次调用都是一次单次问答，不记上文；回答在本机生成，不联网。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次呼叫都是一次單次問答，不記上文；回答在本機生成，不連網。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点「开始吧」会打开一条新对话，在对话里把这个目标聊定——想达成什么、怎么衡量、拆成哪些里程碑。聊定之后，目标会出现在这里，它的进展、任务和简报会慢慢长出来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapping \"Let's Go\" opens a new conversation to settle this goal — what you want to achieve, how to measure it, and which milestones to break it into. Once settled, the goal appears here, and its progress, tasks, and briefings will grow over time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点「开始吧」会打开一条新对话，在对话里把这个目标聊定——想达成什么、怎么衡量、拆成哪些里程碑。聊定之后，目标会出现在这里，它的进展、任务和简报会慢慢长出来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點「開始吧」會開啟一條新對話，在對話裡把這個目標聊定——想達成什麼、怎麼衡量、拆成哪些里程碑。聊定之後，目標會出現在這裡，它的進展、任務和簡報會慢慢長出來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点一下麦克风，说完点「停」，文字会填进输入框，改完再发；点「发送」则停录后直接发出去。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the microphone, tap \"Stop\" when you finish speaking, and the text will fill the input box for you to edit before sending. Tap \"Send\" to stop recording and send it right away."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一下麦克风，说完点「停」，文字会填进输入框，改完再发；点「发送」则停录后直接发出去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下麥克風，說完點「停」，文字會填進輸入框，改完再發；點「傳送」則停錄後直接發出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点一行设为默认，立即生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a row to set it as the default, effective immediately."
