    "现在没有待发的通知。在对话里让智能体按你的确认发一条试试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are no pending notifications. Ask the assistant in a conversation to send one with your confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在没有待发的通知。在对话里让智能体按你的确认发一条试试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在沒有待發的通知。在對話裡讓智慧代理按你的確認發一條試試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在没有待响的闹钟。在对话里让智能体按你的确认设定一个试试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are no alarms set to ring. Ask the assistant in a conversation to set one with your confirmation."
          }
