    "系统只回「过没过」；你的面容或指纹数据永远不出系统，OneDay 碰不到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system only reports pass or fail; your face or fingerprint data never leaves the system, and OneDay can't touch it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统只回「过没过」；你的面容或指纹数据永远不出系统，OneDay 碰不到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系統只回「過沒過」；你的面容或指紋資料永遠不出系統，OneDay 碰不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统没有列出全部快捷指令的办法，只能按名字运行你已经建好的一条；运行会切到快捷指令去执行。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There's no way to list all shortcuts, so only one you've already created can be run by name; running it switches to Shortcuts to execute."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统没有列出全部快捷指令的办法，只能按名字运行你已经建好的一条；运行会切到快捷指令去执行。"
          }
        },
