    "这是每天真正照着去看的那份，由上面的兴趣自动整理。你也可以直接改它：保存后立刻按新简报去看一轮。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the brief actually followed each day, tidied automatically from your interests above. You can also edit it directly: after saving, a round runs right away with the new brief."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是每天真正照着去看的那份，由上面的兴趣自动整理。你也可以直接改它：保存后立刻按新简报去看一轮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是每天真正照著去看的那份，由上面的興趣自動整理。你也可以直接改它：儲存後立刻按新簡報去看一輪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这段对话没能载入": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation couldn't be loaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
