    "预设是整套设置的快照：默认模型加全部辅助分配，一次切换。不是几个模型一起答一道题。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A preset is a snapshot of the whole setup: the default model plus all auxiliary assignments, switched in one go. It is not several models answering one question together."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预设是整套设置的快照：默认模型加全部辅助分配，一次切换。不是几个模型一起答一道题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設是整套設定的快照：預設模型加全部輔助分配，一次切換。不是幾個模型一起答一道題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "验证方式": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
