    },
    "允许后会先把「%@」同步过去再查。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once allowed, %@ will be synced to your server first, then looked up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许后会先把「%@」同步过去再查。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許後會先把「%@」同步過去再查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许的同时系统会顺带查一次今天的步数，这是系统定的，问完就好。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowing this also looks up today's step count once — that's how the system works; it's a one-time check."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许的同时系统会顺带查一次今天的步数，这是系统定的，问完就好。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許的同時系統會順帶查一次今天的步數，這是系統定的，問完就好。"
          }
